<div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW146009554 BCX0">
<p class="callout" paraid="1623851138" paraeid="{aa6d42df-2a30-449b-9556-442e932463b6}{65}"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="PT-BR" lang="PT-BR" class="TextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0" xml:lang="PT-BR"><a href="https://www.gov.br/agricultura/pt-br/assuntos/sanidade-animal-e-vegetal/sanidade-vegetal/planos-de-contingencia-pragas-ausentes " title="" target="_self" data-tippreview-enabled="false" data-tippreview-image="" data-tippreview-title="" class="external-link">Pragas Quarentenárias Ausentes</a></span><span class="EOP SCXW146009554 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"><br /></span></p>
</div>
<div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW146009554 BCX0">
<p class="callout" paraid="1897133007" paraeid="{aa6d42df-2a30-449b-9556-442e932463b6}{82}"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="PT-BR" lang="PT-BR" class="TextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0" xml:lang="PT-BR"><a href="https://www.gov.br/agricultura/pt-br/assuntos/lfda/publicacoes-da-rede-lfda-1/PLANO_DE_CONTINGENCIA_LABORATORIAL_verso1.pdf " title="" target="_self" data-tippreview-enabled="false" data-tippreview-image="" data-tippreview-title="" class="external-link">PLANO DE CONTINGÊNCIA LABORATORIAL INFLUENZA AVIÁRIA DE ALTA PATOGENICIDADE (IAAP)</a></span><span class="EOP SCXW146009554 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"><br /></span></p>
</div>
<div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW146009554 BCX0">
<p class="Paragraph SCXW146009554 BCX0" paraid="1608178655" paraeid="{aa6d42df-2a30-449b-9556-442e932463b6}{107}"><strong><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="PT-BR" lang="PT-BR" class="TextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0" xml:lang="PT-BR">Exercícios Simulados</span><span class="EOP SCXW146009554 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></strong></p>
</div>
<div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW146009554 BCX0">
<p class="Paragraph SCXW146009554 BCX0" paraid="826285680" paraeid="{aa6d42df-2a30-449b-9556-442e932463b6}{113}"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="PT-BR" lang="PT-BR" class="TextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0" xml:lang="PT-BR"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0">É uma atividade controlada que consiste em imitar uma situação que poderia existir na realidade. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0">O exercício simulado é uma forma de praticar, treinar, monitorar e avaliar a capacidade </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0">de resposta a uma emergência. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0">Ele permite que as pessoas pratiquem seus papéis e funções e podem ajudar a desenvolver, avaliar e testar capacidades funcionais de gestão de emergência, procedimentos e mecanismos para responder </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0">emergências, crises e desastres com impacto da Defesa Agropecuária.  Servem para </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0">identificar </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0">os pontos críticos e</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0"> aumentar a capacidade de preparação para resposta antes que uma emergência real ocorra.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW146009554 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
</div>
<div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW146009554 BCX0">
<p class="Paragraph SCXW146009554 BCX0" paraid="788995449" paraeid="{aa6d42df-2a30-449b-9556-442e932463b6}{133}"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="PT-BR" lang="PT-BR" class="TextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0" xml:lang="PT-BR"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0">O objetivo principal de um exercício simulado é validar e melhorar os planos e</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0"> contingência e planos de vigilância existentes</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0">, procedimentos e preparação e resposta para todos os </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0">tipos de incidente, ou os principais incidentes que possam ocorrer com impacto </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0">na</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0"> Defesa Agropecuária.  </span></span><span class="EOP SCXW146009554 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
</div>
<div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW146009554 BCX0">
<p class="Paragraph SCXW146009554 BCX0" paraid="638448927" paraeid="{aa6d42df-2a30-449b-9556-442e932463b6}{149}"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="PT-BR" lang="PT-BR" class="TextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0" xml:lang="PT-BR"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0">Existem diferentes</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0"> tipos de exercícios, incluindo exercícios de mesa baseados em discussão, bem como exercícios baseados em operações, como simulações, exercícios funcionais e exercícios de campo/em escala real. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0"> </span></span><span class="EOP SCXW146009554 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
</div>
<div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW146009554 BCX0">
<p class="Paragraph SCXW146009554 BCX0" paraid="63167321" paraeid="{aa6d42df-2a30-449b-9556-442e932463b6}{159}"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="PT-BR" lang="PT-BR" class="TextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0" xml:lang="PT-BR">Mais Informações acessar os conteúdos:</span><span class="EOP SCXW146009554 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
</div>
<div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW146009554 BCX0">
<p class="Paragraph SCXW146009554 BCX0" paraid="1749180440" paraeid="{aa6d42df-2a30-449b-9556-442e932463b6}{165}"><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="PT-BR" lang="PT-BR" class="TextRun EmptyTextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0" xml:lang="PT-BR"></span><a class="Hyperlink SCXW146009554 BCX0" href="https://www.woah.org/fileadmin/Home/MM/DD_OIE_Guia_de_ejercicios_de_simulacion.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="PT-BR" lang="PT-BR" class="TextRun Underlined SCXW146009554 BCX0" xml:lang="PT-BR"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0" data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink">Guía De Ejercicios De Simulación (OMSA)</span></span></a><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="PT-BR" lang="PT-BR" class="TextRun EmptyTextRun SCXW146009554 BCX0" xml:lang="PT-BR"></span><span class="EOP SCXW146009554 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
</div></div>


